        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ed9e1f428f454fb1ad9ffae3309740ab",
      "statement": "ModelRequest enforces immutability with direct attribute assignment raising DeprecationWarning and directing users to override() method, which creates a new instance with specified field modifications. Supported overrides include model, system_message, messages, tool_choice, tools, response_format, model_settings, and state. Both system_prompt (deprecated) and system_message parameters are supported with mutual exclusivity validation.",
      "evidence": [
