          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:600628d5f7060020785d3e286975332bd146042f2590fd05d04a7625c8ba48c2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bce72bd2703d4798bc83076327e81e31",
      "statement": "Middleware decorators detect sync vs async functions via iscoroutinefunction and generate appropriate wrapper methods. For dynamic_prompt decorators wrapping sync functions, both sync (wrap_model_call) and async (awrap_model_call via async_wrapped_from_sync) are generated to support both execution modes; other decorators generate only the matching execution mode method.",
